  "body": "### What is the issue with the HTML Standard?\n\nIn the original proposal for the popover attribute, we had a `defaultopen` attribute which would show the popover declaratively on page load.\r\n\r\nWe considered renaming it to `popoverdefaultopen` for popovers, but then decided not to and instead add the `defaultopen` attribute in a way that can also be supported on dialog and details elements, potentially blocking on removing the `open` attribute from them: https://github.com/whatwg/html/issues/7785#issuecomment-1310843461\r\n\r\nIt doesn't seem like we fully came to an agreement on a plan for `defaultopen` in that thread, but I've gotten feedback that this would be a useful feature and that we should still try to add it.\r\n\r\n@mfreed7 @annevk @domenic",
